// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Gate — per-developer signing overrides.  TEMPLATE — copy, do not edit in place.
//
//     cp Config/Local.xcconfig.example Config/Local.xcconfig
//
// Config/Local.xcconfig is git-ignored. Config/Build.xcconfig ends with
//     #include? "Local.xcconfig"
// so whatever you set here overrides the repo defaults without producing a diff.
//
// Nothing in this file is secret, but it is machine-specific: your Team ID,
// and (if you are not the repo owner) your own bundle-ID prefix, since only
// one Apple Developer account can own a given App ID.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


// Your 10-character Apple Developer Team ID.
// developer.apple.com/account → Membership details → Team ID.
// Must be a PAID Apple Developer Program team — Family Controls is unavailable
// on a free Personal Team (docs/03-hard-constraints.md #1).
TEAM_ID = XXXXXXXXXX


// ── Optional: build under your own bundle-ID prefix ─────────────────────────
//
// Uncomment BOTH lines together if you are not signing as the repo owner.
// They must stay in sync, and the App Group must exist in your account with
// exactly this spelling.
//
// WARNING: changing BUNDLE_ID_PREFIX means the five App IDs in
// Docs/ENTITLEMENT-REQUEST.md no longer match what you build, and each one
// needs its own Family Controls distribution request under the new prefix.
// Casing is load-bearing (docs/03-hard-constraints.md #5).
//
// Changing APP_GROUP here is NOT sufficient on its own: the literal also
// appears in Config/Gate-App.entitlements, Config/Gate-Extension.entitlements
// and Kernel/Identifiers.swift (`GateID.appGroup`). Change all four, then run
// `make verify`.
//
// BUNDLE_ID_PREFIX = com.yourteam.gate
// APP_GROUP = group.com.yourteam.gate
